{"game": "helldivers-2", "language": "spanish", "appid": 553850, "month": "2024-02", "window": 4, "start_date": 1708732800, "end_date": 1709251199, "month_true_total": 3191, "quota": 38, "returned": 38, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 22:30:37 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "159573233", "author": {"steamid": "76561197986193922", "personaname": "MisterCone | R!NEJO", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Mistercone/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 2288, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 419, "last_played": 1715717282, "avatar": "4e0e201d2254e8da4e7e45d1b9703a9bd8802a77"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Un juego solamente para aquellos defensores de la libertad y la democracia.", "timestamp_created": 1709251089, "timestamp_updated": 1709251089, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.519999980926513672", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "159572912", "author": {"steamid": "76561198144252687", "personaname": "[LV] AndrewMaster01", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198144252687/", "num_games_owned": 113, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 8223, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1460, "last_played": 1778947157, "avatar": "f8507ee8fba75e0d641f16cd080a5226a6cdd56a"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "WE NEED MORE FREEDOM.  INLIST NOW", "timestamp_created": 1709250642, "timestamp_updated": 1709250642, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "159572854", "author": {"steamid": "76561198275705155", "personaname": "eduar117", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/eduar117/", "num_games_owned": 96, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 30649, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 5, "playtime_at_review": 3112, "last_played": 1787682951, "avatar": "914d3e2b1aaf7ade0df48f79544e5a8f64d619cd"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Es un juego HERMOSO, de los mejores MULTIJUGADOR COOPERATIVO que existe. \r\n\r\n-GRAFICOS:\r\nMuy buenos gráficos, muy a la altura de esta generación.\r\n\r\n-COOPERATIVO:\r\nExcelente juego para jugar con amigos y desconocidos... Si estas harto del competitivo, este juego es el indicado para ti.\r\n\r\n-JUGABILIDAD:\r\nMuy buena jugabilidad que engancha desde el tutorial; las sensaciones de las armas, moviento, sistema de salud... y la joya del juego los estratagemas. Se hace un reto cuando te persiguen los terminators o los insectos, ya que te puedes equivocar cuando son largos los codigos. Excelente juego.\r\n\r\n-RENDIMIENTO:\r\nCumple con lo básico para PC, creo que seria el único punto a mejorar, ya que cuento con una laptop con GTX 1650 y i7 10°Gen, lo juego en 720p LOW -- 30 FPS y usando lossles scaling con el FG puedo disfrutarlo a 60 FPS en algunos casos puntuales.\r\n\r\n10/10\r\nLo recomiendo ampliamente y disfrutenlo si es que se animan. \r\nREPARTEN DEMOCRACIA, REPARTEN LIBERTAD!!!!", "timestamp_created": 1709250567, "timestamp_updated": 1709250567, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "159572766", "author": {"steamid": "76561198081529061", "personaname": "Ghostyx", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198081529061/", "num_games_owned": 88, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 21000, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 157, "playtime_at_review": 3628, "last_played": 1787956638, "avatar": "1fa48f3adeb9594213eb5579244b70f7430ff46e"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Promete y medio legalmente", "timestamp_created": 1709250452, "timestamp_updated": 1709250452, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "159572699", "author": {"steamid": "76561198123086288", "personaname": "JoseFreak95", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198123086288/", "num_games_owned": 363, "num_reviews": 42, "playtime_forever": 29062, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 154, "playtime_at_review": 803, "last_played": 1787175716, "avatar": "d6978b640a8ddfa994409dd106a40d2fe8bca82c"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "¿Alguna vez has querido explorar otros mundos?, ¿conocer criaturas exóticas?, o, ¿defender la democracia y la libertad ante cualquier amenaza?.\n\nSi la respuesta a todas esas preguntas es un rotundo y patriótico \"POR SUPUESTO QUE SI, JODER!\", creo que el programa Helldivers es para ti. \n\nVerás...a los patriotas como tú hay que hablarles de frente. Nuestro modo de vida está en peligro y necesitamos valientes como tú dispuestos a defenderlo o incluso morir por él. No trates de dialogar con el enemigo, ellos no lo harán y se comerán a tu familia y a tus vecinos.\n\nConvertirte en Helldiver no sólo elevará tu nivel de patriotismo en un 500% si no que además serás recompensado con los mayores honores que la democracia puede otorgarte...dar tu vida por la defensa de la libertad.\n\nLa libertad te llama, ¿aceptas la llamada?", "timestamp_created": 1709250379, "timestamp_updated": 1709683478, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "159572274", "author": {"steamid": "76561198095071950", "personaname": "YUCA_GAMER", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198095071950/", "num_games_owned": 59, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 7275, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 591, "last_played": 1777845012, "avatar": "1f7731338ad0f13a02bf74a9e5965ec517485877"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Mira como corre el gordo joputa", "timestamp_created": 1709249854, "timestamp_updated": 1709249854, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "159572045", "author": {"steamid": "76561198358432157", "personaname": "Ferran \"wl4ck\" Torres", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/wl4ck/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 2907, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 229, "playtime_at_review": 1488, "last_played": 1787461343, "avatar": "c06c44c3cfeb08e209a87b57ab7eb9821a1b4e96"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Llevo siguiendo el juego desde que salió, dejé de jugarlo porque me pareció monótono y aburrido, estaba esperando una actualización con nuevo contenido, mejores eventos que entreguen una mayor experiencia de juego. \n\nLamentablemente, se han dedicado a aplazar todo tipo de nuevo contenido, cada vez hay más bugs, los mal llamados \"pases de batalla\" son una soberana mierda, indigno, sabiendo que viene de una democracia. \n\nLamentablemente, en este momento no lo recomiendo.", "timestamp_created": 1709249533, "timestamp_updated": 1719854261, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "159571637", "author": {"steamid": "76561198326613710", "personaname": "FunkDog", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198326613710/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 38631, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 328, "playtime_at_review": 9992, "last_played": 1787522945, "avatar": "7ab4c551bdfb3103a35a096c24813bed81b644b1"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Game's still locked for more than a hundred regions by steam.", "timestamp_created": 1709249054, "timestamp_updated": 1715682015, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "159571624", "author": {"steamid": "76561198045324788", "personaname": "Xuzon", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/xuzon/", "num_games_owned": 302, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 3080, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 60, "playtime_at_review": 1259, "last_played": 1787856098, "avatar": "54a5753f37004b52817c5001c47788447fec0120"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "MUERTE A LOS BICHOS", "timestamp_created": 1709249029, "timestamp_updated": 1709249029, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for