d, diría que todo dios conoce este juego y lee las reviews para convencerse de si comprarlo o no xD\n\nDespués de 125 horas, todos los logros, skills, mejoras y pases puedo decir que es un puto juegazo con o sin amigos, la comunidad que tiene y las fumadas que se montan con el \"lore\" que se inventan es god.", "timestamp_created": 1709239054, "timestamp_updated": 1709239054, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 19, "votes_funny": 5, "weighted_vote_score": "0.61234581470489502", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 22, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 5, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "159561835", "author": {"steamid": "76561198348428665", "personaname": "McNuke", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/amelibia/", "num_games_owned": 75, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 2347, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 332, "last_played": 1727621108, "avatar": "d7b7988e7bc32f8e08ab167acd110bf8783e59af"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Aplasta y destruye por la Democracia", "timestamp_created": 1709237727, "timestamp_updated": 1709237727, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "159561735", "author": {"steamid": "76561199633341809", "personaname": "76561199633341809", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199633341809/", "num_games_owned": 1, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 4097, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2096, "last_played": 1748754819, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb